 Versailles","native":"ベルサイユのばら","romaji":"Versailles no Bara","userPreferred":"Versailles no Bara"}},"relationType":"ADAPTATION","resolved":false},{"ids":{"anilist":338,"mal":338},"kind":"ANIME","mediaKey":"al-338","name":"Versailles no Bara","node":{"countryOfOrigin":"JP","description":null,"episodes":40,"format":"TV","id":338,"idMal":338,"isAdult":false,"poster":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx338-dyRsnLdTLZGM.png","title":{"english":"Lady Oscar: The Rose of Versailles","native":"ベルサイユのばら","romaji":"Versailles no Bara","userPreferred":"Versailles no Bara"}},"relationType":"PARENT","resolved":true}],"schemaVersion":"1.1.0","score":{"scale":100,"source":"anilist","value":61},"season":"WINTER","seasonYear":2025,"series":["al-154392"],"seriesIds":[154392],"startDate":{"day":31,"month":1,"year":2025},"status":"FINISHED","studios":[{"animation":false,"id":6429,"name":"Avex Pictures"},{"animation":false,"id":6570,"name":"Shueisha"},{"animation":true,"id":569,"name":"MAPPA"}],"synopsis":{"language":null,"source":"anilist","spoiler":false,"text":"Movie project commemorating the 50th anniversary of the Versailles no Bara manga's publication.\n\nHoping to unite their countries with an alliance, The Empress of Austria arranges her daughter, the delightful yet spoiled Marie Antoinette, to marry the crown prince of France, Louis XVI. Upon arriving in Versailles, the Austrian princess meets Oscar Francois de Jarjayes, Captain of the Royal Guards—a seemingly dashing young man—but to Antoinette's astonishment, he is in fact a woman!\n\nThe youngest daughter of a noble family with a prominent lack of a male heir, Oscar was raised as a boy to continue the family's military legacy. Suffocated by the rigid rules associated with her new position and longing for companionship, Antoinette immediately takes a liking to this intriguing young woman, and wastes no time befriending her. However, as the childish new queen foolishly abuses her power, Oscar is conflicted between maintaining her loyalty to the royal family and addressing the growing concern of poverty among the common people.\n\nRecalling the events of the French Revolution, Versailles no Bara depicts the struggles of two women unjustly burdened by family expectations. Yet, despite being forced to deny their identities at the expense of personal happiness, they march on to become key players in the annals of history.\n\n(Source: MAL Rewrite)"},"tags":[{"name":"Shoujo","rank":100,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Historical","rank":91,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Foreign","rank":83,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Musical Theater","rank":75,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Ojou-sama","rank":72,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Unrequited Love","rank":72,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Military","rank":70,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Tragedy","rank":70,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Royal Affairs","rank":68,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Female Protagonist","rank":66,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Time Skip","rank":66,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Primarily Adult Cast","rank":65,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Crossdressing","rank":64,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Heterosexual","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"War","rank":60,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Gender Bending","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Class Struggle","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Swordplay","rank":50,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Guns","rank":50,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Medieval","rank":50,"spoiler":false}],"titles":{"display":"The Rose of Versailles","english":"The Rose of Versailles","native":"劇場版 ベルサイユのばら","romaji":"Versailles no Bara Movie","synonyms":[{"language":"ja","source":"bangumi","value":"ベルサイユのばら"},{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"凡尔赛玫瑰"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"Versailles no Bara (2025)"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"ベルサイユのばら (2025)"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"A Rosa de Versalhes"}]},"trailer":{"id":"ymTlXvI9AEU","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/ymTlXvI9AEU/h